<Defs>
	<AlienRace.ThingDef_AlienRace ParentName="ParagonBasePawn">
		<defName>NectoliteRace</defName>
		<label>Nectolite</label>
		<description>Nectolites are psychically active mollusks that live near the coasts of warm seas. They have an extensive and decentralized nervous system. Large nerve centers are located on each of the many tentacles. The limbs are numerous and mobile.
Nectolites spend most of their lives in hibernation to conserve the body's resources. Thanks to special psionic abilities, they are able to reflect damage inflicted on them by releasing heat, which is partially absorbed by the xenos, which can lead to overheating.
The functioning of a complex nervous system requires increased consumption of carbohydrates. Most nectolites have a strong shell that grows throughout life and becomes covered with metallic oxides.
Some xenos have a bioluminescent glow.
Military biologists recommend using fire.</description>
